      "kind": "testimony",
      "turn": 4,
      "author": "anon_907",
      "depth": 8,
      "sentimentFlip": -0.86,
      "text": "In Haskell, if it compiles, it works. Your language just isn't expressive enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "t5-few-tests",
