      "turn": 5,
      "author": "anon_907",
      "depth": 9,
      "sentimentFlip": -0.44,
      "text": "...We added a few tests around billing. Just the money parts. That doesn't mean I was wrong."
    },
    {
      "id": "t5-compiler-proved",
